ind":"announcement","title":"Exploring The Sector","summary":"The starmap will serve as a strategic overview of everything you have discovered while exploring. It will show stargate connections, wormhole connections, trade flow, and more which you can filter if it feels too cluttered. You control what you need to see and how much of it you need to see.Everything you've discovered or explored will be there. Stations, asteroid belts, gates, wormholes, and other entities or actors.Here the primary trade route referred to as The Silk Road is highlighted while ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T23:30:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040886","verified_at":"2026-10-24T23:52:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4941160-1847286114037719","game_id":"steam-4941160","kind":"announcement","title":"Planetary Expeditions","summary":"For today's little blog I figured I would show a brief glimpse of gameplay on the planet. You can land on planets, gather supplies, explore, grab loot, interact with the locals. It is intended to heavily expand this feature post launch.You have available to you a rover and your runabout which you land on the planet with while your mothership stays in orbit.Your character will have weapons, tools, scanners, armor, personal shields, throwable shield barriers, grenades etc.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T19:08:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037719","verified_at":"2026-10-23T20:10:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4941160-1847286114033870","game_id":"steam-4941160","kind":"announcement","title":"Modding and Modders","summary":"When I first began working on the game one of the things I knew I must include was modding. So from the beginning the game has been made modder friendly. Whether you want to modify your own game, create your own universe, your own ships, or create entire campaigns for others that will eventually be possible in some form.The initial release will allow you to completely redesign the entire sector. You can move star systems anywhere, place planets, stations, asteroid belts, infrastructure, explorat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:49:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033870","verified_at":"2026-10-22T22:41:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4941160-1847286114030149","game_id":"steam-4941160","kind":"announcement","title":"Ship classes","summary":"The player fleet is taking shape around different roles. The current roster includes the Corvette, Assault Frigate, Destroyer, Heavy Cruiser and Battlecruiser. Each brings a different arrangement of weapons, role bonuses, cargo space and handling, giving you reasons to choose a hull beyond its size.The Corvette is the light escort option: a compact ship with fewer weapon mounts and a smaller hold. Its stronger thrust makes it responsive, but supplies and ammunition take a larger share of the spa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T19:45:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030149","verified_at":"2026-10-22T01:09:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4941160-1846651706696345","game_id":"steam-4941160","kind":"announcement","title":"Exploration Gameplay","summary":"Exploration begins with uncertainty. For the most part, if you are friendly with the region’s inhabitants and have not angered them, and you remain in the inner system, you have support. Whether that’s combat, repairs, towing, you have support. But beyond the inner system, navigation becomes blurred and hazardous. So the radar detects an unknown signal… our game connects the decision to learn what is there and deciding whether you can afford to stay.Sensors reveal information in stages. Thermal ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T18:18:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696345","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4941160-1846651706692743","game_id":"steam-4941160","kind":"announcement","title":"Simulation and Economy","summary":"Our game’s simulation gives ships somewhere to go and cargo a reason to keep moving. The Galaxy Simulation System, or GSS, tracks this activity beyond your current system. The Faction Economy and Logistics (FELS) System extends it with production, logistics and asset replacement pressure.Below are some debugging info screens to help keep track of this simulation.Faction miners supply refineries and that refined stock feeds industry while haulers connect production and supply hubs. Local traders ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T21:01:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692743","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4941160-1839676055886538","game_id":"steam-4941160","kind":"announcement","title":"Extended Combat Gameplay","summary":"Hi everyone, thanks for wish-listing/following the game so far! You're not alone in looking forward to the game. We are participating in Steam Next Fest in the middle of October and should have a demo for you to play by then! Here is a longer video showing some aspects of the real-time combat in the game.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T22:19:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055886538","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4941160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:09Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4941160":"2026-10-26T05:32:09Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4941160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5195950":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4941160","app_id":4941160,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:09Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"e8d85daa3a77591d27281b933711ada06cd5193d34f942469e3f7891d2482ac0","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Experience an epic story in this open-world space exploration rpg. Stranded far from home in a region torn apart by war, you must scavenge, research, and craft what you need to survive as you chart a course through dangerous sectors, uncover rival alien agendas, and search for a way home.\r\n\r\n","publishers":[{"name":"A Paradise Lost Studios"}],"developers":[{"name":"A Paradise Lost Studios"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1795618800,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"A Sector Darkly","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792947064","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4941160